   "textLength": 433,
   "text": "Please note that this questionnaire is not designed for people to complete without any input from their healthcare professional.\nPlease contact your doctor if you are:\nConcerned about your mood; or\nHave completed this questionnaire and it indicates that you may be depressed.\nIf you are having any thoughts of self-harm, please read our leaflet on Dealing with Suicidal Thoughts, which gives advice o",
