   "textLength": 832,
   "text": "This easy to use patient questionnaire is a self-administered version of the PRIME-MD diagnostic instrument for common mental disorders.1 The PHQ-9 is the depression module, which scores each of the nine DSM-IV criteria as \"0\" (not at all) to \"3\" (nearly every day). It has been validated for use in primary care.2\nIt is not a screening tool for depression but it is used to monitor the severity of d",
